# Flutter/Dart
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/build/

# Platform ephemeral (regenerated by `flutter create`/`flutter pub get`)
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/gradle-wrapper.jar
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Pods/

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

# Python (tools/content_compiler/*.py)
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# This project's own top-level build/scratch output (compiled DBs, raw
# Tatoeba downloads, verification logs) — regenerate via
# tools/content_compiler/compile.py and tools/content_compiler/import_tatoeba.py.
/build/

# Compiled content database — a build artifact (spec section 3: "Git holds
# the source content. The compiled runtime artifacts ... are generated,
# not hand-edited."), regenerated by tools/content_compiler/compile.py.
# See docs/setup.md.
**/assets/content/content.db
**/assets/content/content.json

# Bundled Whisper.cpp GGML model (THE-37) — a large (~75MB) third-party
# binary asset, not project source. Download via docs/setup.md.
**/assets/models/*.bin

# sqflite_common_ffi_web generated worker/wasm binaries (regenerate via
# `dart run sqflite_common_ffi_web:setup` in apps/mobile — see docs/setup.md)
**/web/sqlite3.wasm
**/web/sqflite_sw.js
**/.dart_tool/sqflite_common_ffi_web/

# Local AI (THE-51/52) native build workspace: llama.cpp source clone,
# CMake build output (llama.dll etc.), and the downloaded GGUF model are
# large, regenerable, machine-specific build artifacts, not project source.
# See docs/local_ai_setup.md to rebuild.
/native/llama.cpp/
/native/llama_cpp_dart/
/native/llama_cpp_dart_patched/
/native/llama_cpp_dart_probe/.dart_tool/
/native/models/
